<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday, Nidhi</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;0,700;1,500&family=Caveat:wght@500;600;700&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --blush: #fdf1ec;
    --blush-deep: #f7e0d8;
    --card: #fffaf7;
    --rose: #c4467b;
    --rose-deep: #9c3462;
    --plum: #5a2a3c;
    --plum-soft: #7a3b4e;
    --gold: #d8a657;
    --shadow: rgba(122, 59, 78, 0.18);
  }

  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }

  html, body{
    margin:0; padding:0;
    background: var(--blush);
    color: var(--plum);
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* ---------- ambient floating hearts ---------- */
  .heart-field{
    position: fixed; inset:0;
    pointer-events:none;
    z-index: 1;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .heart-field span{
    position:absolute;
    bottom:-10%;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--rose);
    opacity: 0.35;
    animation: floatUp linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes floatUp{
    0%{ transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); opacity:0; }
    10%{ opacity:0.4; }
    90%{ opacity:0.25; }
    100%{ transform: translateY(-110vh) rotate(25deg); opacity:0; }
  }

  /* ---------- entry / cover screen ---------- */
  #cover{
    position: fixed; inset:0;
    z-index: 50;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, var(--blush-deep), var(--blush) 70%);
    text-align:center;
    transition: opacity 1s ease, visibility 1s ease;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  #cover.hidden{
    opacity:0;
    visibility:hidden;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .cover-heart{
    font-size: 44px;
    color: var(--rose);
    animation: pulse 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  @keyframes pulse{
    0%,100%{ transform: scale(1); }
    50%{ transform: scale(1.15); }
  }
  .cover-eyebrow{
    font-family:'Caveat', cursive;
    font-size: 26px;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .cover-title{
    font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.4rem);
    margin: 6px 0 28px;
    color: var(--plum);
  }
  .cover-btn{
    font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    font-weight:500;
    background: var(--rose);
    color: #fff;
    border:none;
    padding: 16px 38px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px var(--shadow);
    transition: transform .25s ease, background .25s ease;
  }
  .cover-btn:hover{ transform: translateY(-2px); background: var(--rose-deep); }
  .cover-hint{
    margin-top:14px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--plum-soft);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* ---------- main content ---------- */
  main{
    position:relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 90px 24px 60px;
  }

  .hero{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom: 70px;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'Caveat', cursive;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
  }
  h1{
    font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 4.2rem);
    margin: 4px 0 14px;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .hero p{
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--plum-soft);
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ---------- polaroid gallery ---------- */
  .gallery{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content:center;
    gap: 26px 22px;
    margin-bottom: 90px;
    padding: 20px 0;
  }
  .polaroid{
    background: var(--card);
    padding: 14px 14px 22px;
    box-shadow: 0 14px 30px var(--shadow);
    width: 230px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    position:relative;
    transition: transform .35s ease, box-shadow .35s ease;
  }
  .polaroid:hover{
    transform: scale(1.05) rotate(0deg) !important;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px var(--shadow);
    z-index: 5;
  }
  .polaroid img{
    width: 100%;
    height: 230px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display:block;
    border-radius: 1px;
  }
  .polaroid .tape{
    position:absolute;
    top:-14px; left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(-3deg);
    width: 70px; height: 26px;
    background: rgba(216,166,87,0.35);
    border: 1px solid rgba(216,166,87,0.5);
  }
  .p1{ transform: rotate(-6deg); }
  .p2{ transform: rotate(4deg); margin-top: 30px; }
  .p3{ transform: rotate(-3deg); margin-top: -10px; }
  .p4{ transform: rotate(5deg); margin-top: 22px; }
  .p5{ transform: rotate(-5deg); }

  /* ---------- letter ---------- */
  .letter-wrap{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }
  .letter{
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 52px 48px;
    max-width: 680px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px var(--shadow);
    position:relative;
  }
  .letter::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    top:0; left:0; right:0;
    height: 6px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--rose), var(--gold), var(--rose));
    border-radius: 18px 18px 0 0;
  }
  .letter-title{
    font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size: 28px;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .letter p{
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--plum);
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  .letter p:last-child{ margin-bottom:0; }
  .signature{
    font-family:'Caveat', cursive;
    font-size: 30px;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    text-align:right;
    margin-top: 26px;
  }

  footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding: 20px 20px 50px;
    font-family:'Caveat', cursive;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--plum-soft);
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
  }

  /* ---------- music toggle ---------- */
  #music-toggle{
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 22px; right: 22px;
    z-index: 40;
    width: 54px; height: 54px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border:none;
    background: var(--rose);
    color:#fff;
    font-size: 22px;
    cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px var(--shadow);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    transition: transform .2s ease;
  }
  #music-toggle:hover{ transform: scale(1.08); }
  #music-toggle.paused{ animation:none; }
  #music-toggle:not(.paused){ animation: spin 6s linear infinite; }
  @keyframes spin{ from{ transform: rotate(0deg);} to{ transform: rotate(360deg);} }

  @media (max-width: 640px){
    .polaroid{ width: 44vw; }
    .polaroid img{ height: 42vw; }
    .letter{ padding: 36px 26px; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .heart-field span, .cover-heart, #music-toggle{ animation: none !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="heart-field" id="heartField"></div>

<div id="cover">
  <div class="cover-heart">❤</div>
  <div class="cover-eyebrow">a little something for</div>
  <div class="cover-title">Nidhi</div>
  <button class="cover-btn" id="openBtn">Open your gift</button>
  <div class="cover-hint">(turn your sound on 🎧)</div>
</div>

<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">happy birthday</div>
    <h1>Happy Birthday, Nidhi! ❤️</h1>
    <p>A few of my favourite pictures of us, and everything I've been wanting to tell you.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="gallery">
    <div class="polaroid p1"><div class="tape"></div><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Nidhi and friend together"></div>
    <div class="polaroid p2"><div class="tape"></div><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Nidhi and friend together"></div>
    <div class="polaroid p3"><div class="tape"></div><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Nidhi and friend together"></div>
    <div class="polaroid p4"><div class="tape"></div><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Nidhi and friend together"></div>
    <div class="polaroid p5"><div class="tape"></div><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Nidhi and friend together"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="letter-wrap">
    <div class="letter">
      <div class="letter-title">To Nidhi</div>
      <p>Happy birthday, Nidhi! ❤️</p>
      <p>Wishing you the happiest birthday! You are one of the warmest-hearted people I've ever met. You're incredibly kind and have always treated me with so much care. You've supported me, guided me like a senior, and never hesitated to tell me when I was wrong. I'm truly grateful to have someone like you in my life.</p>
      <p>I'm so happy that I get to be with you on your special day. I hope we continue making beautiful memories together and always stay close.</p>
      <p>I don't think words can fully express how much you mean to me, but if I could, I'd even code it just to show you how grateful I am. You're one of the most amazing people I've ever met, and I genuinely never want to lose a friend like you.</p>
      <p>Thank you for always being there for me. Once again, happy birthday! Wishing you a year filled with happiness, good health, success, and everything you deserve. 💖</p>
      <div class="signature">with love, always</div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>made with love, just for you 🎂</footer>

<button id="music-toggle" title="Play/pause music">♪</button>
<audio id="bgm" loop src="data:audio/mpeg;base64,"></audio>

<script>
  // ambient floating hearts
  const field = document.getElementById('heartField');
  const glyphs = ['❤','♡','❤'];
  for(let i=0;i<18;i++){
    const s = document.createElement('span');
    s.textContent = glyphs[Math.floor(Math.random()*glyphs.length)];
    s.style.left = Math.random()*100 + '%';
    s.style.animationDuration = (10 + Math.random()*12) + 's';
    s.style.animationDelay = (Math.random()*10) + 's';
    s.style.fontSize = (14 + Math.random()*16) + 'px';
    field.appendChild(s);
  }

  const audio = document.getElementById('bgm');
  const cover = document.getElementById('cover');
  const openBtn = document.getElementById('openBtn');
  const musicBtn = document.getElementById('music-toggle');

  openBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    audio.volume = 0.75;
    audio.play().catch(()=>{});
    cover.classList.add('hidden');
  });

  musicBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if(audio.paused){
      audio.play().catch(()=>{});
      musicBtn.classList.remove('paused');
      musicBtn.textContent = '♪';
    } else {
      audio.pause();
      musicBtn.classList.add('paused');
      musicBtn.textContent = '❚❚';
    }
  });
</script>

</body>
</html>
